<title>USA: IPO FILING - AHL Services Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - AHL Services Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			AHL Services Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			AHLS.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12.50-$14.50/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.25 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.25 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    10,603,430</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		 Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  337,500 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Based in Atlanta, Ga., AHL provides contract staffing and management for labor-intensive, task-repetitive support services for clients in the United States and Europe.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To repay outstanding indebtedness, finance enhancements to the company's management information systems, repurchase an outstanding warrant and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Dec 31:</p>
<p>				   1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		$168,601	   $123,234</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $1,438		 $128</p>
